<title>USA: S.O.I. Industries hires new auditors.</title>
<headline>S.O.I. Industries hires new auditors.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS</dateline>
<text>
<p>S.O.I. Industries said Thursday it dismissed Coopers &amp; Lybrand L.L.P. as its indedependent accountants and hired Dallas-based accountantcy S.W. Hatfield &amp; Associates, effective Aug 14.</p>
<p>S.O.I. said in a statement it had no disagreements with Coopers &amp; Lybrand on any matter of accounting principles or practices, financial statement disclosure or auditing scope or procedure or any reportable events.</p>
